<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/may-16">16 May</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Thado of Mohnyin enters the capital of Ava unopposed</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">After a slow, deliberate advance that let King Nyo's <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vassal">vassals</a> desert him, Thado bribed the Sagaing commander to leave the fight, and Nyo and Queen Bo-Me fled. Thado entered Ava without resistance and took the throne four days later.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/may-20">20 May</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Mohnyin Thado formally ascends the throne of Ava</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The 46-year-old took a long regnal title and made his 15-year-old eldest son heir apparent; his soldiers marked the coronation by sacrificing horses and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cattle">cattle</a> to the Mahagiri spirit. Senior princes had not given up their claim to the throne.</p></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/november-7">7 November</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Lam Sơn rebels ambush and rout a Ming army near Hanoi</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Armed with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hand-cannon">hand cannons</a>, Vietnamese rebels under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/le-loi">Lê Lợi</a> ambushed and routed a Ming army under General Wang Tong between the villages of Tốt Động and Chúc Động, near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hanoi">Hanoi</a>. It was the decisive battle of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lam-son-uprising">Lam Sơn uprising</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lam-son-uprising">Lam Sơn uprising</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ming-empire">Ming Empire</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
